OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786025912
OL,3,CBritons taking 'drastic action' such
OL,4,Cas sleeping in kitchen to cope with
OL,5,Cheat
OL,7,FOne in six Britons are taking "drastic
OL,8,Faction" such as sleeping in the
OL,9,Fkitchen, missing work or booking
OL,10,Fhotels to cope with the heatwaves,
OL,11,FCitizens Advice has found.
OL,13,FThe charity said millions of people
OL,14,Facross the UK are "trapped in homes
OL,15,Fthey can't cool", finding almost half
OL,16,F(44%) feel they lack basic control to
OL,17,Fstop their houses overheating.
OL,26,@oD@_OUpD@GO]vD@SOUwD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
