OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786025912
OL,3,CBritons taking 'drastic action' such
OL,4,Cas sleeping in kitchen to cope with
OL,5,Cheat
OL,7,FIt is demanding Government action on a
OL,8,F"now year-round crisis" of "soaring
OL,9,Fheat in summer and unaffordable energy
OL,10,Fbills in winter".
OL,12,FAction taken by those struggling to
OL,13,Fcope included sleeping in
OL,14,Funconventional places like the
OL,15,Fkitchen, garden, or on a balcony,
OL,16,Ftaking sick days, unpaid leave or
OL,17,Fannual leave, or paying for hotels.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@WO]pD@\OUrD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
