OL,3,CBritons taking 'drastic action' such
OL,4,Cas sleeping in kitchen to cope with
OL,5,Cheat
OL,7,FA further four million said they had
OL,8,Fto use makeshift solutions like taping
OL,9,Ftin foil, cardboard, or damp sheets to
OL,10,Fwindows.
OL,12,FThe study found poorly designed homes,
OL,13,Fwhich act like "heat traps", and the
OL,14,Fhigh cost of cooling equipment such as
OL,15,Fair conditioning were making people
OL,16,Ffeel helpless against the hot weather.
OL,26,@uD@POUuD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
