OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786025912
OL,3,CBritons taking 'drastic action' such
OL,4,Cas sleeping in kitchen to cope with
OL,5,Cheat
OL,7,FHalf (51%) of tenants ` including
OL,8,Fthose who rent privately and those in
OL,9,Fsocial housing ` felt they lack the
OL,10,Fbasic control needed to stop their
OL,11,Fhomes overheating, compared with 40%
OL,12,Fof homeowners, the poll found.
OL,14,FThe study also found 90,000 heat
OL,15,Fnetwork consumers were unable to turn
OL,16,Foff their central heating even in
OL,17,Fsummer.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
