FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786025912
OL,3,CBritons taking 'drastic action' such
OL,4,Cas sleeping in kitchen to cope with
OL,5,Cheat
OL,7,FCitizens Advice chief executive Dame
OL,8,FClare Moriarty said: "For far too many
OL,9,Fpeople, a summer heatwave doesn't mean
OL,10,Fenjoying the sun ` it means being
OL,11,Ftrapped in a sweltering home with no
OL,12,Fcontrol over the temperature.
OL,14,F"We're now facing a year-round crisis,
OL,15,Fwhere poorly designed housing stock is
OL,16,Facting as a giant heat trap in summer
OL,17,Fand as an ice box in winter.
OL,26,@pD@VOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
