CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786025912
OL,3,CBritons taking 'drastic action' such
OL,4,Cas sleeping in kitchen to cope with
OL,5,Cheat
OL,7,F"The Government has a vital
OL,8,Fopportunity to help fix this through
OL,9,Fthe Warm Homes Plan. By investing in
OL,10,Fbetter insulation, ventilation, and
OL,11,Fheat network upgrades, we can ensure
OL,12,Fpeople's homes are warmer in the
OL,13,Fwinter and safer and cooler in the
OL,14,Fsummer."
OL,16,FA Government spokesman said: "We are
OL,17,Fchanging the rules so that for the
OL,18,Ffirst time ever people can access
OL,19,Fgrants for air-to-air heat pumps,
OL,20,Fwhich can cool as well as heat homes.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@HO]xD@^OU
