OL,3,CBritons taking 'drastic action' such
OL,4,Cas sleeping in kitchen to cope with
OL,5,Cheat
OL,7,F"We are already taking action to
OL,8,Fstrengthen protections for tenants
OL,9,Fexperiencing dangerous overheating and
OL,10,Fensuring new residential buildings are
OL,11,Fdesigned to minimise unwanted heat
OL,12,Ffrom the sun."
OL,14,FYonder surveyed 2,105 UK adults on
OL,15,FJuly 1-2.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@NO]
